## Visualization in objective space

[`postProcess.py`](../tree/main/example/ZDTS/ZDT1_10/postProcess.py) creates the final
objective-space comparison. It plots:

- the analytical Pareto-optimal front;
- the NSGA-II sample data;
- the DNN-predicted objectives from the best DNNs listed in `log.out`; and
- recomputed best-DNN objectives by the model.

The resulting figure `objSpacePlot.png` is saved to the run folder.

